{
  "_schema_version": 1,
  "kind": "section",
  "slug": "facet-tabs",
  "label": "Facet tabs",
  "description": "The facet tab bar of an item page: one tab per facet of the object, some carrying a count, and opposite them two avatar stacks, curators and contacts.",
  "role": "tabs",
  "apps": [
    "studio"
  ],
  "patterns": [
    "asset-detail-360"
  ],
  "tags": [
    "tabs",
    "facets",
    "people"
  ],
  "derivedFrom": {
    "surface": "Studio > Catalog > Dataset > General",
    "capturedOn": "2026-09-30",
    "productVersion": "manufacturing.zeenea.app/studio"
  },
  "slots": {
    "tabs": "One tabs instance listing the item's facets in the product's order, a count after the label where the product shows one, the first tab active. {{facets}} is the entity's facets: General first, then one tab per relationship the entity holds (for a Dataset: Fields, Sample Data, Data Quality, Lineage, View 360, Data Model, Activity; for a Data Product: Input ports, Output ports, View 360, Activity), never invented names such as Overview or Schema. {{first_facet}} is the label of the first tab, which is the active one.",
    "people": "Two avatar stacks on the right: Curators then Contacts, initials only."
  },
  "renderNotes": [
    "`tabs` reads `Items` (comma list) and `Active`; it has no count badge, so a count is written into the label text (\"Fields 2\"). The product greys a tab with nothing in it (Sample Data); tabs has no disabled tab.",
    "Parameters, filled by the page that splices it: facets, first_facet, curator_1..2, contact_1..4 (initials). The stacks draw as many avatars as the product shows on the captured page: two curators, four contacts.",
    "Captured value on the Dataset page, 2026-09-30: 'General, Fields 2, Sample Data, Data Quality, Lineage, View 360, Data Model, Activity', Active 'General'; curators AH, ES; contacts AA, TK, ES, ES."
  ],
  "skeleton": {
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "FRAME",
        "name": "Tab bar",
        "layout": {
          "mode": "HORIZONTAL",
          "spacing": 0,
          "primaryAxisAlignItems": "SPACE_BETWEEN",
          "counterAxisAlignItems": "CENTER"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "INSTANCE",
            "name": "Tabs",
            "library": "ds",
            "dsSlug": "tabs",
            "props": {
